    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "thanks. i like the tone, but i'm worried it might sound a bit one-sided to some of our board members. some of them are big proponents of the \"universal museum\" idea—you know, the argument that these items belong to humanity as a whole and are better protected and more accessible in major global hubs. can you revise it to include that perspective so it feels more balanced and acknowledges both the need for justice and the importance of global cultural heritage?",
